_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='arkansas-steel-associates-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Arkansas Truck Center operates from Alma, Arkansas, as a family-owned business specializing in heavy-duty truck parts and recovery services. The company maintains over 30 acres of late-model truck inventory and a 13,000-square-foot warehouse stocked with new, used, and remanufactured components for Peterbilt and Freightliner models.

The center functions as a parts distributor and wrecker service provider, offering worldwide shipping for local pickup or delivery. Its inventory spans new, used, and remanufactured parts, and the company also purchases trucks coast to coast for resale, export, scrap, or parts dismantling. The wrecker recovery service supports heavy-duty equipment retrieval.

The business serves both domestic and international buyers through its shipping program.

