UPDATE companies SET description='Arthrex Portland operates in Portland, Oregon, as part of the global Arthrex medical device company. The business is privately held and describes its culture as that of a family business; the founding year and founders are not disclosed in the available information.

The company develops and manufactures surgical instruments and implantable devices for orthopedics, biologics, cardiology, and other medical specialties. Arthrex states it has pioneered the field of arthroscopy and introduces more than 1,000 new products and procedures each year, with a total portfolio exceeding 24,000 products and surgical procedures.

Arthrex Portland serves healthcare providers, surgeons, and patients across orthopedics, biologics, and cardiology. Its product range addresses areas including shoulder, knee, arthroplasty, imaging, and resection procedures. The company emphasizes comprehensive solutions for diverse clinical demands.

