UPDATE companies SET description='AssureLink, LLC is based in Idaho Falls, Idaho, where it operates as a locally owned and operated business. The company was founded to help elderly individuals and those with unique medical needs maintain independence through medical alert systems, though the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed. The owners established the business out of concern for people at risk of losing their independence due to age, disability, or recovery from medical conditions.

The company provides two types of medical alert devices: an in-home unit designed for those who spend most of their time at home, and a mobile cellular unit that functions anywhere with adequate cellular coverage. Both devices are Medicaid-reimbursable for eligible participants.

AssureLink serves individuals in the senior care and home healthcare markets, including elderly persons, those with limited mobility, patients recuperating from medical conditions, and residents of rural areas where emergency response may be delayed. The company does not list specific industry verticals or B2B clients, focusing instead on direct-to-consumer and caregiver sales.

