UPDATE companies SET description='Auto Parts Company of St. Louis operates from its primary facility in Moscow Mills, Missouri, just outside the St. Louis metropolitan area, with additional locations in Joplin on Highway 43 and St. James on I-44. The company has been in business for decades, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated.

