UPDATE companies SET description='Auto Weld Chassis and Components operates from Danville, Pennsylvania, where it has built a reputation over more than four decades designing and fabricating chassis systems for racing and street-performance vehicles. The company does not disclose a specific founding year or ownership structure, but its history traces back to a focus on American-made engineering for drag strips and street rods.

The shop produces a complete line of mandrel-bent frame rails, chassis kits, housings, and suspension components. Its portfolio includes Featherweight and Dream chassis systems, along with custom suspension setups such as 4-link, ladder bar, front-end assemblies, and Featherweight OEM front suspensions. Most parts are manufactured in-house through a vertically integrated operation, allowing custom specifications on each order. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

Customers range from drag-racing teams competing at NHRA national events to builders of award-winning street-legal cars and trucks. The company serves a worldwide client base in the race car, pro street, and street rod segments, with its race-tested designs featured in magazines and on television.

Auto Weld emphasizes its vertical integration as a key differentiator, stating that in-house manufacturing ensures higher quality and greater custom flexibility than competitors. Its products are promoted as race-proven on both the strip and the street, backed by over 40 years of engineering experience and a commitment to American engineering, quality, and customer service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mandrel bending", "Chassis kit fabrication", "Housing fabrication", "Suspension component fabrication", "Custom suspension design", "4-link suspension fabrication", "Ladder bar suspension fabrication", "Front-end assembly fabrication", "Featherweight OEM front suspension fabrication", "Chassis system design (Featherweight Chassis, Dream Chassis)"], "industries": ["Drag racing", "NHRA competition", "Street performance", "Classic cars", "Street rods", "Pro street", "Race car"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated, most products manufactured in-house", "Race-proven designs tested on street and track", "Custom specifications available on each order", "Over 40 years of engineering and manufacturing experience", "American-made performance chassis and suspension systems"], "facts_used": ["Location: Danville, Pennsylvania -> db", "Business type: manufacturer of race car, pro street, street rod chassis & components -> /about-us", "Experience: over 40 years -> /, /about-us", "Processes: mandrel-bent frame rails, chassis kits, housings, suspension components -> /", "Products: Featherweight Chassis, Dream Chassis systems -> /", "Suspension types: 4-link, ladder bar, front-end assemblies, Featherweight OEM front suspensions -> /", "Vertically integrated, most products manufactured in-house -> /about-us", "Industries: drag racing, NHRA, street performance, classic cars, street rods, pro street -> /, /about-us", "Customer base: worldwide, drag racing winners, award-win