UPDATE companies SET description='Northeast Foods, which operates the Automatic Rolls of North Carolina facility in Clayton, North Carolina, is a cornerstone of the H&S Family of Bakeries alongside H&S Bakery and Schmidt Baking Company. Together they form the largest family-owned variety baker in the United States, a business now in its fourth generation of family ownership and with a heritage spanning more than 75 years. Corporate headquarters are in Baltimore, Maryland, from where the company oversees a network of ten bakeries and more than thirty distribution centers spread across the Eastern seaboard.

The company produces buns, rolls, and bread products at a scale of roughly 1.8 to 2 billion units per year, offering a catalog of over 250 stock-keeping units. Its bakeries are equipped for large-scale, custom-made production, supported by in-house research and development teams that evaluate new ingredients, techniques, and recipes. Beyond baking, Northeast Foods provides distribution services including direct-store delivery (DSD), FOB, and frozen shipping, backed by RFID-embedded shipping trays and a proprietary web-based ordering platform that gives customers unit-level inventory visibility.

Customers range from major quick-service restaurant chains and fast-casual operators to supermarkets, broadline distributors, and small independent retailers. The integrated network serves more than 100,000 locations, delivering fresh and frozen baked goods to restaurants, QSRs, and grocery stores throughout the Eastern United States.

The company emphasizes its hands-on approach to quality and customer service as the foundation of long-term partnerships. Sustainability is also a stated priority, with programs that have eliminated thousands of pounds of plastic packaging, reduced electricity consumption through LED lighting and smart HVAC, cut carbon emissions via a compressed natural gas delivery fleet, and installed rinse-water recovery systems on washing equipment.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom baked goods production", "R&D for new products and ingredients", "Direct-store delivery (DSD)", "FOB shipping", "Frozen shipping", "RFID-enabled inventory tracking", "Web-based ordering platform", "Merchandising solutions", "Large-scale baking (1.8-2 billion rolls/year)", "Sustainable manufacturing practices"], "industries": ["Quick-service restaurants (QSR)", "Fast-casual restaurants", "Supermarkets and grocery stores", "Broadline distributors", "Independent retailers", "Foodservice chains"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "1.8 to 2 billion rolls annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 1.8 billion rolls produced annually with consistent quality", "Nation-leading portfolio of 250+ baked goods SKUs", "Integrated network of 10 bakeries and 30+ distribution centers across the Eastern seaboard", "RFID-embedded shipping trays and proprietary web-based ordering platform for unit-level inventory accountability", "Sustainability initiatives including plastic waste reduction, LED lighting, natural gas fleet, and water recovery systems"], "facts_used": ["Company is part of H&S Family of Bakeries -> /about-us", "Family-owned for 4 generations, over 75 years -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Baltimore, MD; 10 bakeries, 30+ distribution centers -> /about-us", "Over 250 SKUs of baked goods -> /about-us", "1.8 billion rolls per year -> /services", "Nearly 2 billion rolls come off lines annually -> /services", "Serves 100,000+ restaurants, super