UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1991 in Middleton, Wisconsin, Automation Components Inc (ACI) has grown to a 200-plus employee manufacturer of building automation sensors. The company operates four facilities in Middleton where it engineers, designs, and manufactures its product lines.

ACI produces a range of sensors for temperature, humidity, pressure, current, gas, air quality, and power metering, along with interface devices, wireless MESHNET 900 MHz modules, and BACnet/Modbus communicating sensors. The company states it builds thousands of custom sensors daily and offers customization of probe lengths, wiring, fittings, private branding, and packaging for all volume needs.

Its sensors serve building automation, HVAC, data centers, refrigeration, air handling units, chiller systems, and indoor air quality applications.

ACI emphasizes American manufacturing, ISO 9001:2015 certification, live technical support via phone, email, chat, or video, fast shipping with no minimum order, and a five-year warranty on humidity sensors. The company says its culture of empowered, long-term employees drives custom solutions and philanthropic achievements.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','RoHS','UL 916 (Energy Management Equipment)','CE','UKCA','WEEE','CAN ICES-3/NMB-3','BTL Certified (BACnet)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Temperature sensor manufacturing", "Humidity sensor manufacturing", "Pressure sensor manufacturing (wet and dry media)", "Current sensor manufacturing (split-core and solid-core switches/transmitters)", "Gas sensor manufacturing (CO2, toxic, combustible, refrigerant)", "Interface device manufacturing (signal conversion)", "Wireless MESHNET 900 MHz spread spectrum sensor networks", "BACnet MS/TP and Modbus RTU communicating sensors", "Air quality sensor manufacturing (VOC, particulate matter, CO2)", "Power metering solutions", "Custom sensor design and manufacturing", "Field calibration of humidity sensors", "Private labeling and custom packaging", "Technical application support"], "industries": ["Building automation", "HVAC", "Data centers", "Refrigeration", "Air handling units", "Chiller systems", "Indoor air quality", "Energy management"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in the USA across four Middleton, WI facilities", "Thousands of custom sensors manufactured daily", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Live technical support (phone, email, chat, video)", "No minimum order quantity and fast shipping"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1991 in Middleton, WI -> db", "200+ employees -> db", "Four facilities in Middleton, WI -> /", "Manufactures temperature, humidity, pressure, current, gas, air quality, power metering sensors -> /", "Custom sensor manufacturing (thousands daily) -> /", "Industrie