UPDATE companies SET description='Avatar Natural Foods was founded in 2011 and operates from a 70,000-square-foot facility in Henderson, Nevada. The company grew from the culinary vision of chef Diego Silva, creator of the Eat Pita brand, who set out to make clean, healthy American food affordable and accessible.

The company manufactures and distributes a line of gourmet, all-natural food products that span deli salads, Mediterranean dips, grab-and-go meals, baked goods, pita bread, pita chips, frozen entrees, and cookies. In addition to its own brands, Avatar provides private-label manufacturing, co-packing with package design and shipping, wholesale distribution, and e-commerce fulfillment with 24-hour order processing. The plant holds FDA registration, USDA Organic certification, HACCP, and GMP certification, and runs hundreds of SKUs through its production lines.

Avatar serves independent retailers, supermarkets, greengrocers, delicatessens, garden centers, pound shops, cash-and-carry outlets, and expatriate shops across the continental United States.

Silva''s founding mission—to replace artificial ingredients with fresh, non-GMO, preservative-free recipes at an affordable price—still drives the operation. The company emphasizes that controlling every step from recipe development to distribution lets it pass cost savings to customers while maintaining a "healthy, premium, and fresh" standard.', certifications=ARRAY['FDA-REGISTERED','HACCP','GMP','USDA ORGANIC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food manufacturing", "Food distribution", "Private labeling", "Co-packing", "Package design", "Packing and shipping", "Wholesale distribution", "E-commerce fulfillment", "Recipe development", "Production kitchen operations", "Test kitchen operations"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Food manufacturing", "Food distribution", "Retail", "E-commerce", "Wholesale"], "materials": ["All-natural ingredients", "Non-GMO ingredients", "Preservative-free ingredients", "No artificial flavors or colors"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "24-hour order processing for e-commerce fulfillment", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["70,000 sq ft facility with integrated production and test kitchens", "FDA-registered, USDA Organic, HACCP, and GMP certified", "Private labeling and co-packing including package design, packing, and shipping", "E-commerce fulfillment with 24-hour order processing", "All-natural, non-GMO ingredients with no preservatives, artificial flavors, or colors"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2011 -> db", "Headquarters Henderson, Nevada -> db and homepage", "70,000 sq ft facility -> homepage", "Sister brands: YaYa''s Kitchen, Tuscany Cookies, Eat Pita, Bettr Bowl, Cali Crumble -> homepage", "Chef Diego Silva creator of Eat Pita -> homepage", "Certifications: FDA-registered, USDA organic, HACCP, GMP -> db and homepage", "Services: private labeling, co-packing, wholesale, e-commerce fulfillment with 24-hour processing -> services page", "Customer base: independent retailers, supermarkets, greengrocers, delicatessens, gard