UPDATE companies SET description='Backwoods Custom LLC operates from Phoenix, Arizona, where it designs and builds custom cabinetry for residential projects across the state. The company does not publish a founding year, and its founders are not named in public materials.

The shop produces custom kitchens, built-ins such as entertainment centers and home offices, custom closets and storage, specialty woodwork, shelving, barn doors, and French doors. Work flows from an initial consultation through 3D design and rendering, then to a build phase that uses precision CNC cutting equipment alongside skilled woodworking, and finishes with professional installation. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are disclosed.

Projects range from full kitchen layouts to one-off built-in features and closet systems, all tailored to the specific dimensions and use cases of each space.

The company emphasizes a “Built Different” approach: no one-size-fits-all cabinets, local Arizona craftsmanship, precision via CNC and 3D design, and attention to fit and finish from design through installation. It operates as a licensed, bonded, and insured contractor (ROC #352389).', certifications=ARRAY['Licensed, bonded, and insured','Arizona ROC #352389']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry design and build", "Custom kitchen cabinetry", "Built-in cabinetry (entertainment centers, home offices, shelving)", "Custom closet and storage design", "Specialty woodwork", "Custom shelving", "Barn door fabrication", "French door fabrication", "CNC cutting", "3D design and rendering", "Professional installation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC cutting equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No one-size-fits-all cabinets; every project designed and built for the specific space", "Locally built in Phoenix, Arizona with quality materials and skilled workmanship", "Combines detailed 3D design with precision CNC cutting for accuracy before installation", "Full-service process: consultation, 3D design, CNC build, professional installation", "Licensed, bonded, and insured (Arizona ROC #352389)"], "facts_used": ["Phoenix, Arizona location -> db", "Backwoods Custom LLC -> /about", "Licensed, bonded, insured with ROC #352389 -> /", "Custom cabinetry, kitchens, built-ins, closets, specialty woodwork, shelving, barn doors, French doors -> /services and /", "Process: consultation, 3D design, CNC build, installation -> /", "Uses precision CNC cutting and 3D design -> / and /services", "Serves homes throughout Arizona -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Backwoods Custom LLC designs and builds custom cabinetry for homes throughout Arizona.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", 