UPDATE companies SET description='Balance Clothing Company operates from Charleston, West Virginia, where it was founded in 2007 by David Collins. Collins started the business while searching for harmony among the creative process, printing, and design, and the company has grown steadily since its inception.

The firm functions as a custom art agency with an in-house screen printing and vinyl workshop. The shop also produces rigid signage including 3-D lettering, Lexan and metal signs, trade show booth backdrops, tents, canopies, and a full range of print collateral from business cards to brochures.

Balance serves clients across multiple states, with noted accounts in Chicago, Columbus, Cincinnati, and Hawaii.

