UPDATE companies SET description='Bald Ridge Enterprises operates from Cody, Wyoming, serving customers across Wyoming and Montana. The company was founded nearly four decades ago on family values and a dedication to craftsmanship, growing from a small local shop into a recognized contractor. It is certified as a Women-Owned Small Business with US Federal Contractor Registration.

The company provides complete metal construction services with all fabrication performed in-house. Its capabilities include pre-manufactured steel buildings, metal roofing systems, metal siding and exterior components (soffits, fascia, gutters, downspouts), specialty metalwork such as snow bars and chimney caps, and carpentry. The team handles design, fabrication, and installation for projects of varying scale.

Bald Ridge serves commercial, agricultural, residential, institutional, and government clients. Examples include custom roofing and siding for homes, pre-engineered steel buildings for farms and commercial facilities, and architectural sheet metal for institutional and government projects throughout the two-state region.

The company emphasizes in-house fabrication for quality control, adherence to the Architectural Sheet Metal Manual, and engineering for the harsh weather conditions of Wyoming and Montana. Its family-focused culture and status as a women-owned small business are cited as key differentiators, along with standard one-year warranties and extended manufacturer guarantees.', certifications=ARRAY['US Federal Contractor Registration']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Architectural sheet metal fabrication", "Pre-manufactured steel building fabrication", "Metal roofing system fabrication and installation", "Metal siding, soffits, fascia, gutters, and downspouts fabrication", "Specialty metalwork (snow bars, chimney caps, custom planter boxes)", "Carpentry", "In-house design and engineering", "Project management from concept to completion"], "industries": ["Architectural sheet metal", "Commercial construction", "Agricultural buildings", "Residential construction", "Institutional facilities", "Government facilities"], "materials": ["Steel", "Metal"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house fabrication for complete control and superior quality", "Builds to the Architectural Sheet Metal Manual, the industry''s highest standard", "Engineered for harsh Wyoming and Montana weather conditions", "Women-Owned Small Business with US Federal Contractor Registration", "Family-focused culture built on trust and integrity"], "facts_used": ["Company located in Cody, Wyoming -> db", "Founded nearly four decades ago on family values -> /about-us", "Women-Owned Small Business with US Federal Contractor Registration -> /about-us", "In-house fabrication for all products -> /about-us", "Services: pre-manufactured steel buildings, metal roofing, metal siding, specialty metalwork, carpentry -> /services", "Industries served: commercial, agricultural, residential, institutional, government -> /about-us", "Builds to Architectural Sheet Metal Manual -> /about-us", "Engineered for harsh Wyoming and Montana weather -> /", "Standard 1-year warranty with extended manufacturer guarantees -> /", "Family-focused culture -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "All fabrication done in-house for superior precision", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Small business", "Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bald-ridge-enterprises-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Ballard Sheet Metal Works Inc. has operated from Seattle, Washington since 1907. The family-owned business began over a century ago and remains under family ownership today.

The shop provides custom metal fabrication, welding, field measuring, and installation services across the Greater Puget Sound area. Its capabilities include shearing (24 gauge to 3/8″ steel, up to 10 ft wide), forming, and welding of galvanized, hot-rolled, cold-rolled, and stainless steels, aluminum, copper, zinc, Cor-Ten, brass, and diamond plate. Products range from flashing, backsplashes, and corner guards to countertops with integrated sinks, custom hoods, fireplace surrounds, railings, stairs, awnings, and marine components such as fire dampers, HVAC ducting, and tanks.

The company serves residential homeowners, local contractors, and architects, with a notable portfolio in marine and architectural metalwork. Customers include individuals seeking custom countertops or fireplace surrounds, as well as commercial clients needing HVAC components and tank fabrication.

