UPDATE companies SET description='Barrett Petfood operates from Brainerd, Minnesota, where it was founded in 2006. The company began when agricultural entrepreneur Mike Barrett purchased a piece of equipment intended for agricultural manufacturing, only to realize it was designed for food production. Seeing an opportunity, Mike and his children, Tom and Sarah Barrett, pivoted into the pet food industry. Mike later transitioned ownership to Tom and Sarah, while he continued supplying ingredients from his farm.

Today, Barrett runs two facilities: the original Brainerd plant and a 160,000-square-foot facility in Little Falls, Minnesota, opened in 2020 with two additional production lines. The company offers extrusion, freeze-drying, milling, and automated packaging, producing hundreds of formulas for dogs, cats, reptiles, birds, livestock, and zoo animals. Its services span diet formulation, ingredient sourcing, processing, packaging, and global distribution.

Barrett serves emerging and established pet food brands seeking a co-manufacturing partner. Its customer base includes companies in the super-premium kibble and kibble-plus categories, as well as brands requiring specialized diets for exotic and farm animals. The company positions itself as an extension of its partners'' teams, handling supply chain logistics and production details.

The business was built on a simple promise: “If we wouldn’t feed it to our own pets, you won’t find it in our products.” Tom and Sarah Barrett emphasize a relationship-based philosophy, personal involvement in each brand, and a “Don’t Say No” mindset that drives innovation. They cite transparency, integrity, and rigorous food-safety standards as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Extrusion", "Freeze-drying", "Milling", "Processing", "Automated packaging", "Diet formulation", "Ingredient sourcing", "Distribution", "Co-manufacturing", "Brand services"], "industries": ["Pet food", "Super premium kibble", "Kibble plus", "Reptile food", "Bird food", "Livestock feed", "Zoo animal feed"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Extrusion equipment", "Freeze-drying equipment", "Automated packaging equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned, nimble execution with personal owner involvement in each brand", "Relationship-based philosophy prioritizing integrity, transparency, and partnership", "\u201cDon\u2019t Say No\u201d innovation mindset enabling complex super-premium formulas", "Clean, modern facilities with industry-specific extrusion, freeze-drying, and automated packaging equipment", "Supply chain expertise and rigorous, laboratory-like food safety standards"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 -> /about", "Headquarters in Brainerd, Minnesota -> db", "Family-owned, founded by Mike Barrett, now led by Tom and Sarah Barrett -> /about", "Two facilities: Brainerd and Little Falls (160,000 sq ft added 2020) -> /about", "Processes: extrusion, freeze-dried, milling, automated packaging -> /services, /", "Produces hundreds of formulas for dogs, cats, reptiles, birds, livestock, zoo animals -> /about", "Relationship-based philosophy, ''Don''t Say No'' philosophy -> /about", "Promise: ''If we wouldn''t feed it to our own pets, you won''t find it in our products'' -> /about, /"], "company_type": "