UPDATE companies SET description='Battlefield Fabrication operates from Searcy, Arkansas, where it runs a family-owned construction and building-supply business. The company does not disclose its founding year or the names of its founders, but it describes itself as a small, family-owned operation that has grown into a licensed and insured contractor serving White County and the surrounding Central Arkansas region.

