UPDATE companies SET description='Beltway Used Auto Parts LLC has operated as an environmentally conscious auto recycler from its Hyattsville, Maryland location since 1999. The company was established to provide quality used automotive components to the surrounding community, leveraging a yard management system that updates inventory daily.

The business specializes in late-model foreign and domestic auto and truck parts, ranging from wiring harnesses and differential assemblies to diesel particulate filters and bumper assemblies. Beltway ships nationwide via UPS, FedEx, and freight carriers, while its own fleet delivers six days a week across Maryland, Delaware, Virginia, the District of Columbia, and Pennsylvania. A standard four-month warranty covers all parts, with extended options available, and the company also purchases vehicles directly from sellers.

The company’s bilingual staff (Se Habla Español) supports a diverse client base.

