UPDATE companies SET description='Bentley Injection Molding, Plastics & Tooling operates from Mesquite, Texas, in the Dallas-Fort Worth metroplex. The company has served a global customer base for over 30 years, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

