UPDATE companies SET description='Berkwood Farms operates from Des Moines, Iowa, as a farmer-owned coalition of independent family farmers. The company does not disclose a founding year, but its structure reflects generations of family farming, with many participants representing second through fifth generations in animal husbandry. Ownership rests directly with the farmers who raise the pigs, ensuring that proceeds flow back to the producers.

The coalition produces 100% certified pure heirloom Berkshire pork, raised without antibiotics or hormones under a strict code of humane and environmentally responsible animal husbandry. With over 90 farmer-members, Berkwood Farms has grown into one of the largest American suppliers of this specialty pork, achieving national distribution while maintaining its commitment to sustainable farming practices.

